 *
 * Centralised secret-resolution module.
 *
 * Resolution order
 * ─────────────────
 * 1. AWS Secrets Manager  (always attempted when NODE_ENV !== 'development')
 * 2. Local .env.test file (fallback when Secrets Manager is unreachable, OR
 *    when NODE_ENV === 'development' and USE_SECRETS_MANAGER is not set)
