 *                           value of APP_SECRET_ID, then to 'app/secrets'.
 *   USE_SECRETS_MANAGER   – Set to 'true' to force Secrets Manager even when
 *                           NODE_ENV === 'development'.
 *   ALLOW_LOCAL_FALLBACK  – Set to 'true' to allow falling back to .env.test
