 * Centralised secret-loading module.
 *
 * Strategy
 * --------
 * Production  → AWS Secrets Manager (one API call per secret name).
 * Development → Falls back to values in .env.test when
 *               (a) NODE_ENV is "development" or "test", OR
 *               (b) the Secrets Manager call fails (e.g. no network / no IAM
